      <p>We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-fg mt-8 mb-3">7. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about these terms, reach out at zulhampratama@rakyzu.my.id.</p>
